slide('manual-interpret','A procedure can change behavior without changing quality.','<p class="big">Before calling an edit better, inspect both the account and the execution.</p>\n<div class="two-col"><div><h2>Behavior</h2><p>Which skill was read?<br>Which checks or retries ran?<br>Did the edit add work?</p></div><div><h2>Outcome</h2><p>Was the account correct?<br>Was the explanation accurate?<br>Did the same case improve?</p></div></div>','Participants do not need to manufacture a failure. A live success remains a success. The recorded rehearsal later supplies a useful no-gain example.')
