slide('editor','Management would like to automate management.','<p class="big">Give an editor agent the current harness and an execution record. Ask it for two competing changes.</p>\n<div class="two-col"><div><h2>It may edit</h2><p>Instructions, skills, and bounded workflow rules.</p></div><div><h2>Keep fixed</h2><p>The model, tested tools, fixtures, grader, and budget controls.</p></div></div>\n<div class="bottom-note">Please review its changes.</div>','This is the same fixed model with a different task and context. The editor can produce code/configuration artifacts but cannot improve scores by rewriting the definition of correct work.')
