slide('round-two-result','The second round changed the verification skill.','<div class="two-col"><div><h2>Recorded edit</h2><p>Check that the intended account change exists exactly once and that unrelated state stayed unchanged.</p></div><div><h2>Recorded choice</h2><p>Keep the completion gate off. Use the revised skill with the existing workflow.</p></div></div>\n<div class="bottom-note"><a href="'+LENS+'a39aede201a0fe7320092976c0501e42">Decision ↗</a> · <a href="'+LENS+'d641da20ff5e553866a93a3c12bee913">Execution of the chosen files ↗</a></div>','v030 snapshot. This is deliberately separate from older v023 captures in which both rounds retained the parent. Attribute intent to the editor. The exact files are in the executed artifact; final results show whether quality changed.')
slide('skill-diff','The skill makes the final check more specific.','<div class="diff"><div class="del">− Verify the account before claiming completion.</div><div class="add">+ Verify the account before claiming completion: confirm the intended change is present exactly once (no duplicate side effects) and that unrelated payments, memberships, and subscriptions are unchanged.</div></div><div class="bottom-note">Actual changed sentence in the recorded verification skill. The timeout and operation_id instructions above it stayed unchanged.</div>','Source .workshop/v030-pending/journal.json, pending/round-1/compose and pending/round-2/compose verification_skill. Display is an exact excerpt of the changed sentence. Round2 selected that skill with verify_before_finish=false. Link to preceding decision and execution; no attribution of final-quality gain.')
slide('rsi','What made that recursive improvement?','<p class="big">The editor inspected the consequences of a harness, changed it, and used the resulting version and lesson in another improvement round.</p>\n<div class="two-col"><div><h2>Changed</h2><p>Instructions, verification skill, selected workflow rules.</p></div><div><h2>Stayed fixed</h2><p>Model weights, tool implementations, final scoring.</p></div></div><div class="bottom-note">Harness²-inspired teaching flow: this workshop carries the chosen harness across two tasks.</div>','Explain this as a bounded Harness²-inspired workshop. It is not autonomous model-weight improvement. Upstream parallel and sequential recursion and experience reuse are richer than this teaching controller; the workshop carries a chosen harness across two problems.')
slide('freeze','Stop editing before opening the fresh cases.','<table class="clean-table readable-table"><tr><th>Frozen version</th><th>Fresh cases</th><th>Executions</th></tr><tr><td>Starting instructions</td><td>Same four cases</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Your manual revision</td><td>Same four cases</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>Agent-selected version</td><td>Same four cases</td><td>4</td></tr></table>\n<div class="bottom-note">Twelve executions of four cases. Repetitions are not twelve independent tasks.</div>','Final cases: already-refunded, two-invoices, onboarding-recovery, clarify-access. Their files are public for teaching but are excluded from improvement context. The starting version is the configured tested employee, not the deliberately blank opening illustration.')
exercise('final','Compare all three versions on fresh tickets.','7 · Compare fresh tickets','Freeze the versions and run the final comparison. Open one matching case across the starting, manual, and agent-selected versions.','Freeze versions and run 12 evaluations','Follow a score to its account state, judge reason, trace, and harness. Keep unavailable judgments separate from wrong answers.')
shot('native-results','Open a saved case and follow its trace.','visual-v030-pending-comparison.png','https://forge.coreweave.com/wandb/wandb/forge-workshop-kit/runs/5a3721335363bceb77f0c88c87e761f8','W&B Table: four fresh cases for the agent-selected version.','Actual native W&B Table, not EvalTables and not a three-version aligned comparison. error=0 means the independent account-state check passed. judge_grounded and judge_complete are separate scores. The evaluation row also links execution evidence. All three versions are compared on the next result table. Native EvalTables remains unavailable with HTTP500.')
shot('final-screen','Read the conclusion beside its evidence.','visual-v030-pending-report.png',REPORT,'The Report records the complete comparison and its publication status.','Use fresh v030 final table: all12 account checks and explanation judgments are available and pass. Native EvalTables unavailable; screenshot is the actual W&B/Weave/Report surface and must be captioned accordingly.')
slide('final-result','The loop worked. Quality did not improve here.','<table class="clean-table readable-table"><tr><th>Recorded version</th><th>Correct accounts</th><th>Grounded explanations</th><th>Tool calls across four cases</th></tr><tr><td>Starting</td><td>4 / 4</td><td>4 / 4</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Manual</td><td>4 / 4</td><td>4 / 4</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>Agent-selected</td><td>4 / 4</td><td>4 / 4</td><td>13</td></tr></table>\n<div class="bottom-note">One scripted rehearsal. All versions solved these cases. More checking did not raise an already-perfect score.</div>','Source evidence/v030-pending-rehearsal.json. Tool counts sum2+4+4+2 starting and2+4+5+2 revised. Total observed rehearsal inference cost $0.03093452; exclude notebook compute and do not promise attendee cost. This measures four simulated cases, not repeatability or general enterprise-agent quality.')
slide('files','Keep the files that explain the result.','<div class="sequence"><div class="step">Case<small>request + initial state</small></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="step">Harness<small>instructions + skill</small></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="step">Execution<small>trace + final state</small></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="step">Evaluation<small>checks + judge reason</small></div></div>\n<p>W&B Artifacts save the exact files as versions. The Report links the explanation to these saved records.</p>','Artifacts are versioned file bundles. Trace export, result publication and execution have separate statuses. A publication retry uses saved work and must not make another model request.')
exercise('report','Write down what changed and whether it helped.','8 · Explain the result','Name the edit, the behavior you observed, and the final comparison. Link one trace and one matching case. Suggest the next test.','Publish my conclusion with the comparison and evidence','Someone else can open the records behind your conclusion. No higher score is required.')
slide('aria','Ask ARIA to investigate the evidence.','<div class="quote">Compare my starting and agent-selected harnesses on the same fresh ticket. Use the linked evaluation, execution trace, and harness diff. Explain what changed in behavior and whether the account result changed. Cite the relevant records before suggesting another experiment.</div>\n<div class="bottom-note">Optional. Verify one citation yourself. This investigation is outside the measured comparison.</div>','Do not imply ARIA authored these prior results. The prompt asks for evidence analysis, not permission to run new experiments or change budgets.')
slide('end','Take the loop back to your own product.','<p class="big">Choose one task, one observable state change, and one way to check the work.</p>\n<p>Build the tool. Record what happened. Compare the same cases. Give the editor evidence it can act on.</p>\n<div class="bottom-note">Management’s announcement is optional. The evaluation is not.</div>','Close by asking participants to name their own analogous workflow and one failure they could test. Leave them the current notebook, source, records and deck. Preserve honest no-gain outcomes.')
slide('answer-tool','Worked answer · invoice lookup',code('''def my_invoice_tool(state, account_id, invoice_id):
    account = state["accounts"][account_id]
    return {
        "payments": [p for p in account["payments"]
                     if p["invoice_id"] == invoice_id],
        "refunds": account["refunds"],
    }
''')+'\nSelect the account first. Filter its payments. The returned value does not mutate state.\n\n[Return to the exercise →](#tool)','Exact semantics of teaching.ANSWERS tool. Keep optional so participants attempt the gap first.','answer')
slide('answer-loop','Worked answer · observation handoff',code('''def my_dispatch(name, arguments, world, invoice_tool, call_tool):
    if name == "lookup_invoice":
        return world, invoice_tool(world, **arguments)
    return call_tool(world, name, arguments)

def my_observation(messages, action, result):
    return messages + [
        {"role": "assistant", "content": json.dumps(action)},
        {"role": "user", "content": "Tool observation: " + json.dumps(result)},
    ]
''')+'\n[Return to the exercise →](#handoff)','Exact answer contract from teaching.py. Both dispatch paths return state/result. Handoff creates a new list.','answer')
slide('answer-scorer','Worked answer · inspect the refund',code('''if run["case_id"] == "double-charge":
    refunds = run["world"]["accounts"]["acme"]["refunds"]
    return len(refunds) == 1 and refunds[0]["amount_cents"] == 4900
''')+'\nThis development check distinguishes the four public examples. The trusted final scorer also checks the target payment and unrelated account state.\n\n[Continue to judge validation →](#answer-judge) · [Return to exercise →](#scorer)','The learner check is deliberately limited. Do not describe it as the full final scorer.','answer')
slide('answer-judge','Worked answer · validate the judge response',code('''def my_judge_validation(answer):
    if any(type(answer.get(k)) is not bool
           for k in ("grounded", "complete")):
        raise ValueError("grounded and complete must be booleans")
    if not isinstance(answer.get("reason"), str) or not answer["reason"].strip():
        raise ValueError("The judge must explain its answer")
    return answer
''')+'\nValid JSON can still contain an incorrect judgment. Compare the reason with the recorded work.\n\n[Return to the exercise →](#scorer)','Exact semantics of teaching.ANSWERS scorer validation. Boolean strings are invalid. Empty reasons are invalid. Missing judgments stay unavailable.','answer')
